<p>Exchanged? No, not exactly, nor what I intended to imply. But style choices can push something beyond the parameters of clinical tone and these choices do so for me. We can debate the subjectivity of said parameters but that's turtles all the way down and might be a conversation better suited a writing help forum post.</p>

